  "debrief": "MoonPup was a textbook pull: the owner could print tokens, raise the sell tax to anything, and sells were gated behind a whitelist. Liquidity sat in the deployer's wallet the whole time. The chat was three bots and an admin with a countdown.",
  "documents": [
